(197, 'Kristi Sharp', 'info@ecminibus.co.uk', '1', NULL, 32, NULL, 'Heathrow Airport', '51.4700223', '-0.4542955', 1, NULL, 'Thistle Hyde Park Kensington Gardens, Bayswater Road, London, UK', '51.5108322', '-0.184024', '44 Seater Bus', 'One Way', NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, 0.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '0.00', NULL, 0.00, '2023-06-15', '07:40:00', NULL, '2023-06-05 00:00:00', 'Bank', 'Invoiced', 'settled', '+44 877-574-7845', 'AA46', '', NULL, '', 'Heathrow Airport', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '24 pax via Windsor Castle 4 hours of viewing time and than final drop at Thistle London Hyde Park Hotel. Please find below the directions to the Group Travel area. Upon your arrival at Heathrow airport, our driver will meet you at the Group Travel area, located immediately after the customs exit in the main arrivals hall (Once everyone in the group has collected all their luggage) you will see the signs for car rental walk in that direction and on your left-hand side there will be an exit door, if you exit that door and see the gentleman or lady wearing a High-Visibility jacket, and tell them your flight number (AA46) your final destination (London). At that point, he will radio through to central coach park and the bus will be released to make its way to you this can take 10 to 15 minutes. If you experienced any issues please call the office directly 0208 611 2965.', NULL, 'EC197', NULL, 550.00, 0.00, -550.00, 0.00, 0.00, 550.00, 'yes', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 24, 24, 24, NULL, '29', '1 Hr 3 Mins', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '45 min after', '', '', '', NULL, '1', 'ECM0128001', '0', '2023-06-05 10:57:30', '2023-06-15 16:04:50'),
