(397, 'Beitz, Katie', 'Viator@gmail.com', '6', NULL, 30, NULL, 'Southampton Cruise Terminal', '50.9105468', '-1.4049018', 2, NULL, 'Hilton at the Ageas Bowl, Southampton, Botley Road, West End, Southampton, UK', '50.92491829999999', '-1.320355', 'Sedan', 'One Way', NULL, 0.00, NULL, 501.00, 0.00, NULL, 501.00, NULL, 0.00, 501.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '501.00', NULL, 0.00, '2023-07-22', '08:00:00', NULL, '2023-06-14 00:00:00', 'Bank', 'Invoiced', 'settled', '+1 2532225670', '', '', NULL, 'Disney Dream', 'Southampton Cruise Terminal', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2 pax. As directed 4 hours .  Just to clarify, \r\n\r\n1. We would like to be picked up as we disembark the cruise at 08:00am.\r\n2. Highlights of Portsmouth \r\n3. Village of Chawton (Chawton house and Jane Austens home) with a quick stop to see the house and gift shop.\r\n4. From Chawton make way to Brighton \r\n5. Highlights of Brighton\r\n6. Primarily we would love see the highlights along the coast from Brighton as we make our way back to Southampton hotel (Hilton at the Ageas).\r\n\r\nFor an additional £255, which will cover the mileage and 2 extra hours. Therefore the service will be an 8 hour day start to finish.', NULL, 'EC397', NULL, 300.00, 0.00, 201.00, 0.00, 0.00, 300.00, 'yes', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2, 2, 2, NULL, '5', '16 mins', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '45 min after', '', '', '', NULL, '1', '982102647', '0', '2023-06-14 09:04:25', '2023-07-22 07:11:05'),
